# carbon palette — LSS AARRGGBB (alpha first, 8 digits)
# Base slots copied verbatim from LDLib2's assets/ldlib2/lss/carbon.lss:
#   bg #101010  surface #181818  raised #232323  hovered #2e2e2e  sunken #0a0a0a
#   line #16ffffff (9% white)  lineStrong #2effffff (18% white)
#   text #ededed  textDim #9a9a9a  textFaint #6b6b6b
#   accent #f0a04b  accentHover #f7b46c  accentPressed #d98a35  accentWash #3df0a04b
# Semantics reuse the DUSK dark-authored values verbatim: a graphite dark surface
# is no more demanding than dusk's, so no adjustment was required.
#
# CONTRAST (WCAG, semantic ink vs carbon surface #181818 / raised #232323):
#   danger 4.5/4.0  success 7.0/6.2  warn 7.0/6.2  listWhite 7.0/6.2  listBlack 4.5/4.0
#   danger/sunken 5.1  success/sunken 7.8  warn/sunken 7.8 (feedback bar)
#   text/surface 15.2  textDim/surface 6.3  textFaint/raised 3.0 (muted)  accent/surface 8.3
#   onAccent/danger 3.9  onAccent/success 2.5 — large hero label only, the
#   pre-existing DUSK pairing (white on the green resume fill), unchanged.
#   disabledSurface/togglePressed keep DUSK's neutral #191d26/#1a1f29 fills.
bg=#FF101010
surface=#FF181818
raised=#FF232323
hovered=#FF2E2E2E
sunken=#FF0A0A0A
line=#16FFFFFF
rowAlt=#0AFFFFFF
lineStrong=#2EFFFFFF
text=#FFEDEDED
textDim=#FF9A9A9A
textFaint=#FF6B6B6B
accent=#FFF0A04B
accentHover=#FFF7B46C
accentPressed=#FFD98A35
accentWash=#3DF0A04B
danger=#FFE5484D
dangerHover=#FFEC6165
dangerPressed=#FFCC3D42
success=#FF3FB950
successHover=#FF4FCB61
successPressed=#FF2E9E3D
successWash=#2E3FB950
warn=#FFD29922
scrim=#A6000000
disabledSurface=#FF191D26
disabledBorder=#0DFFFFFF
transparent=#00000000
togglePressed=#FF1A1F29
scrollThumb=#3AFFFFFF
scrollThumbHover=#66FFFFFF
buttonText=#FFFFFFFF
onAccent=#FFFFFFFF
listWhite=#FF3FB950
listBlack=#FFE5484D
closeHover=#FFE5484D
closePressed=#FFCC3D42
